    {"type":"text","id":"l1_n","x":40,"y":312,"width":360,"height":69,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"dry-run before any apply\nlint must pass: non-blocking in CI, “treated\nas blocking for the sprint”\nsyntax check passes, blocks merge in CI\na human reads the dry-run output","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":191014},
    {"type":"text","id":"l2_n","x":430,"y":312,"width":360,"height":41,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"a method and a pass criterion for each gate\n(the table below)\nexit criteria fixed before work starts","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":191015},
    {"type":"text","id":"l3_n","x":820,"y":312,"width":360,"height":69,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"a five-command health suite:\nnodes ready · no pods outside Running\nno failed Helm releases\nno certificate not ready\nnode utilisation","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":191016},
    {"type":"text","id":"l4_n","x":1210,"y":312,"width":340,"height":83,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"ten hard constraints: dry-run first, an explicit\nflag for any production apply, unseal keys never\ncommitted, secrets store unsealed before its\nconsumers deploy, encrypted files re-encrypted\non edit — and five more on logging, storage\nand force-pushes","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":191017},

    {"type":"text","id":"tbl_lbl","x":40,"y":410,"width":700,"height":14,"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","text":"layer 2 · gates per workstream, as the file writes them","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":191018},
    {"type":"rectangle","id":"tbl","x":40,"y":430,"width":1500,"height":100,"strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"#1e293b","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"roundness":{"type":3},"seed":191019},
    {"type":"text","id":"tbl_t","x":58,"y":441,"width":1464,"height":78,"strokeColor":"#22c55e","text":"A  lint · syntax · dry-run of the secrets-store role · every replica unsealed · server certificate ready · synced secrets still syncing\nB  the same, plus a restart test: delete one replica, wait a minute, expect it unsealed without a human\nC  lint and syntax after each role fix · a dry-run per role · fewer policy violations than before · none new outside the owned roles\nD  every failing benchmark item dispositioned · control-plane items signed off · fewer failures on re-scan\nE  a hygiene report exists · low-risk items cleaned up with the operator · no new stuck pods","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.3,"autoResize":false,"seed":191020},
    {"type":"arrow","id":"a_l2_tbl","x":595,"y":353,"width":0,"height":55,"points":[[0,0],[0,55]],"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","strokeWidth":2,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"startArrowhead":null,"endArrowhead":"arrow","seed":191021},

